# Copy to /etc/brief-relay/maintainers.env (root, mode 0600). gateway-setup.sh writes it from
# MAINTAINERS_ADDRESS, or asks for it on its first run. Not secret, but not the repo's either.
# Where the nightly check mails what is wrong (README "The nightly check"): plain name@domain
# addresses, separated by commas.
MAINTAINERS_ADDRESS=
